      <data key="e_source_section">SAP Agent Gateway for A2A Communication</data>
      <data key="e_evidence">- **Policy enforcement points** exist at multiple levels: at the gateway entry (it checks if the calling user (human/agent) has access to call the dedicated agent), before agent-to-agent hand-off , and at the target application (The policy enforcement point between an agent and the API/tools/MCP will be released in H2/2026).</data>
